# Theme

Tokens live in `src/styles/global.css` (Tailwind v4, no config file). Use token classes (`bg-background`, `text-primary`, `border-brass`), never raw hex in components.

| Token | Value | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `--background` | `#fbf7f2` cream | page |
| `--foreground` / `--primary` | `#1f2f27` / `#1f3a2e` botanical green | text, primary buttons, footer |
| `--accent` | `#b3202a` ladybird / awning red | CTAs, spots, focus ring |
| `--blush` / `--rose` | `#f3dcd6` / `#c9707a` | petal washes, emphasis italics |
| `--sage` | `#cfd9c8` | secondary text on green, done states |
| `--brass` | `#b8935a` | hairlines, borders |

Type: Cormorant Garamond (display; italic for emphasis) and Jost (body), both variable, self-hosted via `@fontsource-variable`. Headings are display, never uppercase-heavy.

Motif: the **ladybird** (`src/components/Ladybird.tsx`, `public/favicon.svg`) is the logo mark; red spots echo the shop's red-spotted awning (`.awning` strip). Use it sparingly: header, footer, one hero perch, section divider, driver portal.

Motion: CSS only, always inside `prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference`. Hit targets ≥ `min-h-10`.

Placeholder imagery is the `.bloom` gradient until real photography exists; replace via product `image_url`.

Palette is a designed interpretation; the live site exposes no CSS. Re-sample from owner-supplied logo/photos when available.
